cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "OASIS Route"
message: "If you use OASIS Route in research or a write-up, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Fahim Hussain"
    alias: FAHTHIZ
repository-code: "https://github.com/FAHTHIZ/OASIS-ROUTE"
abstract: >-
  First-party, open-source inference-routing companion for OASIS and a standalone self-hosted LLM
  gateway. It discovers verified free inference tiers, connects user-authorized provider accounts,
  and routes requests by capability, policy, and available quota behind OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible APIs.
keywords:
  - llm-gateway
  - llm-router
  - free-tier
  - openai-compatible
  - inference
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
